# r2_cfs_v701.kzs -- logical sites of case R2 for the stage C connector comparison (kzs-sites 1;
# docs/event_semantics.md section 3, docs/instr_candidate_clang.md).  Build: the ENV tree of cFS v7.0.1 (bundle
# 088b2fa8; cFE c5fb2b4d, OSAL d2d877a6, PSP c4b3b0b6; env/build_cfs.sh, env/CONDITIONS.md), native_std, cpu1.
# Paths are relative to the bundle root; every ref is a line at that revision.  The meaning of each site is that
# of the F0 plan kairos/profiles/cfs-v7.0.1/observe/sites.kzp; a label is reused only where the point is the same.
# The three SB call sites are those the F0 plan names (cases/R2.md section 5): they pass CFE_SB_Global.AppId and
# ES and EVS reach them before the SB task stores its id.  Not a research condition; the plan of a pilot comparison.
kzs-sites 1
